Attribution should cite the associated manuscript and this repository. Molecular-calibration files curated from the MolTest data set retain the upstream CC BY 4.0 licensing and should also cite the original MolTest record by J. Hutter and T. M. A. Muller, Zenodo record 7841955.

Files copied from the public CP2K source tree retain their upstream CP2K provenance and licensing. Users should consult the CP2K repository for the license terms attached to those source data files.

The vendored ACWF verification scripts under `scripts/acwf-verification/upstream/` are distributed under the MIT license included in `scripts/acwf-verification/upstream/LICENSE`.
